ScummVM web build - license and origin
=======================================

scummvm.js and scummvm.wasm are the official ScummVM emscripten (WebAssembly)
build, version 2.10.0git, compiled from the ScummVM project.

  Project:     https://www.scummvm.org/  /  https://github.com/scummvm/scummvm
  License:     GNU General Public License v2 (GPL-2.0), see
               https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html
  Full source: https://github.com/scummvm/scummvm (dists/emscripten builds it)

This copy was obtained from the public ScummVM web demo deployment
(scummvm.kuendig.io) run by the ScummVM web port maintainers.

Game data is NOT bundled and is not covered by this license. ScummVM runs the
games only when you provide their data files (see games/<slug>/README.md) from
copies you own, e.g. the original CDs or the Backyard Sports re-releases by
Mega Cat Studios / Playground Productions. Do not share game data files.